# AffiLayer security headers — Cloudflare Pages applies this file
# (apps/web/public/_headers) to every response it serves for affilayer.com.
# It does NOT cover go.affilayer.com: the Worker sets its own headers.
#
# CSP design notes (verified against the app, 9 Nov 2026):
# - script-src 'self' only, NO 'unsafe-inline': index.html has no inline
#   executable script (the boot loader is inline *styles*, not script), Vite
#   emits external module scripts from the same origin, and React attaches
#   handlers via addEventListener, not inline on* attributes. The JSON-LD
#   <script type="application/ld+json"> blocks are non-executable and are
#   not blocked by script-src. Exception: https://static.cloudflareinsights.com
#   is allowed for the Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon (Q8, 10 Nov 2026 —
#   free, cookieless; the beacon loads only when VITE_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN
#   is set at build time, see src/main.tsx).
# - style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline': REQUIRED. index.html carries an inline
#   <style> block (boot-loader keyframes), a <noscript><style> block, and
#   inline style="" attributes in the boot loader; React also renders inline
#   styles at runtime. Without 'unsafe-inline' the first paint breaks.
#   Trade-off: an injected <style> could exfiltrate data via CSS selectors,
#   but there is no sensitive data rendered in class/id attributes, and the
#   alternative (hashing every inline style) is not maintainable for an SPA.
# - connect-src: the only fetch/XHR/WebSocket origins the app uses are
#   Supabase (REST https + Realtime wss) and the tracking Worker
#   (payments.ts fetches go.affilayer.com). Cloudflare Web Analytics
#   (beacon.min.js, loaded only when VITE_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN is set —
#   see src/main.tsx) posts to cloudflareinsights.com; its script comes
#   from static.cloudflareinsights.com (see script-src below). No fonts,
#   analytics, or other third-party origins exist in the app. Tracking
#   links (/c/, /s/) are top-level navigations, not fetches, so they need
#   no connect-src entry.
# - img-src 'self' data:: only same-origin images are rendered (logo-mark.svg,
#   og-image.png); advertiser "creatives" URLs are stored but never rendered
#   as <img>. data: covers inline SVG data URIs if any are added later.
# - font-src 'self' data:: no webfonts are loaded today; data: allows a
#   bundled font if one is added without weakening script/style policy.
# - frame-ancestors 'self' + X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN kept in sync:
#   framing is same-origin only (XFO is the legacy fallback for old browsers).
# - HSTS: max-age 1 year + includeSubDomains (covers go.affilayer.com in
#   browsers once seen). No `preload`: the domain is not submitted to
#   hstspreload.org, and the directive alone would imply otherwise.
# - Permissions-Policy: the app uses no camera, microphone, geolocation,
#   payment-request, or USB features; all are disabled outright.
# - nosniff + strict-origin-when-cross-origin referrer-policy are kept as
#   before (they were already live on affilayer.com).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://cpaxrqwqyjutrscqvqjp.supabase.co wss://cpaxrqwqyjutrscqvqjp.supabase.co https://go.affilayer.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
